        "effect": "The bridge collapses in the creature\u2019s square, then rolls initiative. The DC to Grab an Edge on the bridge is 38. Once the bridge begins to collapse, the river\u2019s Swim DC increases to 36 as the water churns with the falling debris. A creature that starts its turn swimming within 15 feet of the bridge takes 10d6 bludgeoning damage (DC 41 basic Reflex save).",
